pan>阅读量的多少是衡量语文能力高低的标准之一，建议在阅读时做好阅读笔记和读后感想的记录。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"bullet\">③</div>\n        <div class=\"item-content\">\n          <span class=\"bold-blue\">加强写作训练：</span>作文是语文的半壁江山，<span class=\"highlight-yellow\">“得作文者得语文，得语文者得天下”</span>，因此日常要多读好作文，积累素材和写作思路，提高作文分数。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"illustration-placeholder books-placeholder placeholder\">[Books & Apple<br>Illustration]</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-title title-math\">2.数学</div>\n      \n      <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"bullet\">①</div>\n        <div class=\"item-content\">\n          日常学习新课过程中，注重对基础知识理解和记忆，<span class=\"highlight-yellow\">并且会应用基础知识来解题。</span>基础知识包括公式，公理，定式，定理等。可以尝试利用思维导图对比、类比梳理知识间的内在联系，高效、快速的完成对基础知识的理解和记忆。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"bullet\">②</div>\n        <div class=\"item-content\">\n          <span class=\"highlight-yellow\">运用思维导图将题型进行分类，</span>按个人掌握情况分类，方便考试前针对薄弱点复习。\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"bullet\">③</div>\n        <div class=\"item-content\">\n          <span class=\"highlight-yellow\">注重纠错本，</span>日常做错的题及时整理到纠错本上，分析错因及正确的解题方法，每周、每月及考前定期复习，保证错题不再错！\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"illustration-placeholder compass-placeholder placeholder\">[Compass<br>Illustration]</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
